flowchart TD
    OS["Android OS"] -->|low memory| PD["process death"]
    PD -->|later| RE["recreate task + Activity"]
    subgraph VM["ViewModel"]
        SSH["SavedStateHandle (from Bundle)"]
        RK["restored keys: query, step, form"]
        DER["derive UiState"]
    end
    RE --> SSH
    SSH --> RK
    RK --> DER
    subgraph SSOT["SSOT"]
        ROOM["Room (Ch 3)"]
        DS["DataStore (Ch 4)"]
    end
    DER -->|read durable data| ROOM
    DER -->|read config/session| DS
    US["uiState: StateFlow"]
    DER --> US
    CMP["Compose (rememberSaveable for pure-UI bits)"]
    US -.-> CMP
